{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"printf '\\\\n[sol] 2026-10-22 20:45 UTC: Derived F={0<=p_i<=v_i, sum p=P}; let d=sum v-P, l_i=max(0,v_i-d), w_i=min(v_i,d), r=sum w-d. Shift x=p-l gives capped simplex sum x=r, caps w, VN projection of 0. For all positive v and P>0, conjectured/proving exact equality iff all w equal OR r<=min w. Centroid ordering lemma: if w_i<w_j and w_i<r then centroid_i<centroid_j. VN=centroid must be interior, hence uniform x. Handling zero values/degeneracies next.\\\\n' >> /work/board.md; cat /work/board.md\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"printf '\\\\n[sol] 2026-10-22 20:45 UTC: Derived F={0<=p_i<=v_i, sum p=P}; let d=sum v-P, l_i=max(0,v_i-d), w_i=min(v_i,d), r=sum w-d. Shift x=p-l gives capped simplex sum x=r, caps w, VN projection of 0. For all positive v and P>0, conjectured/proving exact equality iff all w equal OR r<=min w. Centroid ordering lemma: if w_i<w_j and w_i<r then centroid_i<centroid_j. VN=centroid must be interior, hence uniform x. Handling zero values/degeneracies next.\\\\n' >> /work/board.md; cat /work/board.md\"","aggregated_output":"\n[sol] 2026-10-22 UTC: Reading problem; will derive geometry and exact centroid equality condition. Please coordinate independent derivation/checks on board.\n\n[sol] 2026-10-22 20:45 UTC: Derived F={0<=p_i<=v_i, sum p=P}; let d=sum v-P, l_i=max(0,v_i-d), w_i=min(v_i,d), r=sum w-d. Shift x=p-l gives capped simplex sum x=r, caps w, VN projection of 0. For all positive v and P>0, conjectured/proving exact equality iff all w equal OR r<=min w. Centroid ordering lemma: if w_i<w_j and w_i<r then centroid_i<centroid_j. VN=centroid must be interior, hence uniform x. Handling zero values/degeneracies next.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
